## Source templates inlined as plain presets.
##
## One band, nothing else: a 250 Hz carrier with delta beats
## stepping 3 -> 0.5 Hz. No noise bed. Headphones required.

off: -
delta-3: 250+3/20
delta-2: 250+2/20
delta-1: 250+1/20
delta-half: 250+0.5/20

